==Round of 16==

===Germany vs Paraguay===
Two minutes from the end of regulation time, [[Oliver Kahn]] sent a goal kick down the field, which was received by [[Michael Ballack]]. Ballack passed to [[Bernd Schneider (footballer)|Bernd Schneider]] whose cross from the right was turned in by [[Oliver Neuville]] on the half volley at the near post from six yards out. In the 92nd minute, [[Roberto Acuña]] was sent off after punching Ballack.<ref>{{Cite web|url=https://www.theguardian.com/football/2002/jun/16/worldcupfootball2002.sport14|title = Germany 1 - 0 Paraguay|date = 16 June 2002}}</ref>
